# ── WHAT THIS FILE MAY NOT REMOVE — #402 ─────────────────────────────────────
#
# The builder stage runs `npx tsc --noEmit` BEFORE `npm run build`, and that is
# the type-check gate (tsconfig.json says so, and says why). A gate can only
# check files that reached the build context. Anything this file excludes which
# tsc still compiles — or which a compiled file imports — is not "excluded", it
# is a build failure:
#
#   error TS2307: Cannot find module '../../scripts/_maintenance-guard'
#
# That is what `e2e` and `scripts` did here. #328 deliberately removed "scripts"
# from tsconfig's exclude list, because those files import the same `db` the
# application does and write to the live database by hand. From that moment the
# type-check compiled them, while this file was still deleting them, and the
# Docker build could not pass — thirteen TS2307s, none of them a type error.
#
# So `e2e` and `scripts` are NOT listed below, and must not be re-added while
# tsconfig compiles them.
#
# `__tests__` above is kept and is NOT the same case: Docker matches these
# patterns at the context root only, so it excludes the root __tests__/ — which
# tsconfig excludes too — and has never touched src/__tests__. Those suites were
# always copied and always type-checked, which is why three of them appeared in
# the thirteen errors. `*.test.*` was dropped: it matched nothing (there are no
# root-level test files), and had one ever been added, tsconfig would compile it
# while this file deleted it — the same failure again, waiting.
#
# NONE OF THIS REACHES THE SHIPPED IMAGE. The runner stage copies exactly
# .next/standalone, .next/static and public — so what the builder holds costs
# build-context upload and nothing else: under 400 KB for both directories,
# once *.tsbuildinfo above stops the 323 KB of stale compiler state travelling
# with them.
#
# Pinned by src/__tests__/unit/docker-build-context-holds-what-tsc-checks.test.ts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Large directories not needed to build the app. These were being copied into
# the build context, inflating the image and the builder's working set.
artifacts
screenshots
exports
tests
docs
.turbo
playwright-report
test-results

# Misc
.DS_Store
*.log
Thumbs.db
